### Database

- PostgreSQL.
- Prisma ORM or Drizzle ORM.
- Database migrations.
- Foreign keys, indexes, unique constraints, and transactions.

### Authentication

Use a maintained authentication library compatible with the selected stack.

Support secure email/password authentication, email verification, password reset, and optional OAuth.

### Payments

Use Razorpay or another provider that supports the required payment workflow in India.

Use test mode during development.

### Meetings

Use the Google Calendar API to create calendar events with Google Meet conference data.

Never generate fake Google Meet URLs.

### Real-time communication

Use WebSockets, Server-Sent Events, or another appropriate real-time mechanism for queue updates.

